"[`make_moons`](https://scikit-"
"learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.datasets.make_moons.html) de "
"[scikit-learn](https://scikit-learn.org/).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2) '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
